sequenceDiagram
    actor E as Encadrant
    actor S as Stagiaire
    participant NG as Angular
    participant EC as EvaluationController
    participant ES as EvaluationService
    participant FC as FicheAppreciationController
    participant FS as FicheAppreciationService
    participant NS as NotificationService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over E: stage en fin de parcours
    E->>NG: saisit l'evaluation (note, type)
    NG->>EC: POST /api/evaluations
    EC->>ES: create(request)
    ES->>DB: evaluation + maj statut du stage
    ES->>NS: notifie le stagiaire (nouvelle evaluation)
    ES-->>NG: 200

    E->>NG: remplit la fiche d'appreciation
    NG->>FC: POST /api/fiches/stage
    FC->>FS: createFicheStage(request)
    FS->>DB: fiche_appreciation_stage
    FS->>NS: notifie le stagiaire (fiche remplie)
    FS-->>NG: 200

    S->>NG: consulte ses evaluations et fiches
